  242:                                 ;   IC4 4X crank (CKP) input-capture ISR, far-called from bank-0 7E67: sets PUMP_BACKUPFLAGS.6, clears IC4F, reads
  243:                                 ;        TCNT and computes the interrupt latency IC4_LATENCY = TCNT - TIC4.
  244:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Mid-instruction banner: the real entry is b1:81E3 (far call from bank0 7E67), the IC4 (4X
  245:                                 ;        crank CKP) interrupt handler. It sets PUMP_BACKUPFLAGS.6, clears IC4F, records IC4_LATENCY, checks the
  246:                                 ;        TIO ref period ($14A4) against the cal windows, counts CKP edges for the cam/CKP match tests (P0251,
  247:                                 ;        P0335), checks the high-res encoder count for P0370, sets cranking fuel, schedules the backup reference
  248:                                 ;        on
  249:                                 ;   inferred [B, pass A]: writes TFLG1
