 2053:                                 ; calc_engine_speed_902A
 2054:                                 ;   analysis [high]: OBD1 calculate_engine_speed. Takes an atomic snapshot of the captured reference time and
 2055:                                 ;        overflow count (TIC_CAP_RPM / TOVFL_CAP_RPM) and forms the 24-bit period since the last poll. It
 2056:                                 ;        normalises the period by right-shifting (RPM_SCALE_CNT), computes RPM_RAW = CAL_RPMSCALE1 / period with
 2057:                                 ;        FDIV, then shifts back. FLAGS1.7 is a re-entry lock; FLAGS0.4 skips one sample after resync.
