 2118:                                 ; calc_RPM_and_engine_mode_9098
 2119:                                 ;   analysis [high]: OBD1 CRANK_RUN_MODE_SELECT, run on each reference from calc_TOVFL_CAP_RPM_8A40. engine_RPM is
 2120:                                 ;        the average of RPM_RAW and the previous value; RPM_5 is lag-filtered with k_22C7, and RPM_6 adds a
 2121:                                 ;        clamped 4x(raw-filtered) lead term. It sets ENGMODEFLAG: b7 crank below k_226E (300 rpm), b6 idle, b4
 2122:                                 ;        cyl-balance enable, b5 overrev above CAL_SAFETY_OVERREV_RPM with hysteresis. It also sets $5A.0 from the
 2123:                                 ;   OBD1 CRANK_RUN_MODE_SELECT (match 0.61 p2-dataref): STARTING MODE ETC. DETERMINATION
 2124:                                 ;   Trigger = CMP sensor
