 2575:                                 ; FETCH_BASIC_APP_FUEL
 2576:                                 ;   analysis [high]: Pedal fuel from FETCH_DES_PEDAL_PWR. In crank it adds the constant crank fuel and caps the
 2577:                                 ;        pedal adder at CAL_CRANK_APP_MAX_ADDER. In run it returns min(pedal fuel, governor/limiter max fuel), and
 2578:                                 ;        a governed value below CAL_MIN_GOVERNED_FUEL becomes 0.
