 2837:                                 ; RUN_EGR_DELTAFUEL_LIM
 2838:                                 ;   analysis [high]: Rate limit on increasing fuel when EGR is active (Configuration_set_2.2). Applies only with
 2839:                                 ;        pedal <= $DE, VSS >= 19 mph, and EGR vac+baro <= CAL_FUEL_LIM_EGR_MAP. The rise from APP_FUEL_REQ is
 2840:                                 ;        limited to FAST_SLEW (big step) or SLOW_SLEW per reference. With this cal's values (EGR_MAP=0, STEP=0) it
 2841:                                 ;        is effectively off.
