 2926:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 2927:                                 ; READ_PUMP_MAPS
 2928:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: OBD1 READ_PUMP_MAPS: converts fuel_quantity to a pump pulse/angle command (deg*8192/720).
 2929:                                 ;        Below 64 mm3 it uses tbl3D_PUMP_RPM_LOW_FUEL[RPM_6, fq*1.25] + tbl2D_9pt_2A55; above that the HIGH_FUEL
 2930:                                 ;        3D+2D tables, clipped at 96 mm3. At zero fuel it takes the minimum pumping angle table. It adds
 2931:                                 ;        FTS_FUEL_PW_ADJ and the pump calibration-resistor trim (Pump_Cal_Ptr 3D[RPM, fuel]) and stores
 2932:                                 ;        PUMP_CAL_ADJ_CR
 2933:                                 ;   OBD1 READ_PUMP_MAPS (match 0.97 p1-global): PUMP Calibration calculations
 2934:                                 ;   called from: calc_fuel_quantity
