 2955:     9662 15 5B 20                       bclr <brake_rpm_flags,$20           ; 9662  15 5B 20      brake_rpm_flags .5 RPM above 1200 (clear below 900) - skip  = 0 | OBD1: CLR 0031.b5, clear if below 900
