 2959:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 2960:                                 ; dead_alt_pump_maps_by_RPM_band_9668
 2961:                                 ;   UNREACHABLE: skipped by the unconditional jmp 9761 at 9665. Alternate pump-angle path: finds the RPM band
 2962:                                 ;        (breakpoints b1_d_9626, 0-1800 rpm in 300 rpm steps), looks up two of the seven 17x9 3D maps listed at
 2963:                                 ;        b1_d_962D (cal 2318-26B4, fuel_quantity x baro) and interpolates between them by RPM, then adds the
 2964:                                 ;        low/high-fuel 2D table like the live path and joins it at 97CF. Fuel system only - not trans code. The
 2965:                                 ;        OBD1 OS has a nop here; this OS jumps over it, so cal 2317-26CD is not used.
 2966:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Misaligned: 967E is the operand of 'subd #$9626' that starts at 967D. Part of unreachable
 2967:                                 ;        code (9668-975F, skipped by 'jmp 9761' at 9665). That code interpolated between the 7 RPM-banded pump
 2968:                                 ;        maps (b1:962D) at RPM breakpoints b1:9626 (0..1125 rpm), with an ITS_Cold_Base+2 based column scaling.
 2969:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
