 3376:                                 ;        boost + DRAGTQ_ADJUST and clears filter states. Then (optionally cylinder balance) computes filtered RPM
 3377:                                 ;        error, P/I/D terms, IDLE_FUEL_REQ = P+I+D clamped 0..CAL_IDLE_MAX_FUEL_FINAL, then the stall-save
 3378:                                 ;   OBD1 IDLE_MODE_GOVERNOR (match 1.00 p1-exact): Engine idle speed governor.
