 3609:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 3610:                                 ; CYLBAL_CLEAR_ACCEL
 3611:                                 ;   analysis [high]: Reloads CYLBAL_PACETMR from CAL_CYLBAL_PACETMR and zeroes the RPM sum array 18F3-1901.
 3612:                                 ;   OBD1 CYLBAL_CLEAR_ACCEL (match 1.00 p1-global)
 3613:                                 ;   called from: DO_CYLBAL
 3614:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
