 3623:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 3624:                                 ; CYLBAL_ADJUST_AND_DIAG
 3625:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Averages each cylinder's RPM sum (rounded /PACETMR), computes per-cylinder speed difference
 3626:                                 ;        vs the next-firing cylinder x CAL_CYLBAL_GAIN and subtracts it from CYL_BAL_ADAPT[cyl] (saturating). Then
 3627:                                 ;        removes the mean so adapts sum to zero, clamps each to CAL_CYLBAL_MAXADJ(-32)..MINADJ(+96), counts
 3628:                                 ;        failures in BALANCE_FAIL_CT_ARRAY when the negative limit is hit and calls the per-cylinder DTC routine
 3629:                                 ;   OBD1 CYLBAL_ADJUST_AND_DIAG (match 0.98 p1-global): looks like cylinder balance stuff in here
 3630:                                 ;   called from: DO_CYLBAL
 3631:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
