 3652:     9AC5 7F 18EF                        clr >CYLBAL_CYL_COUNTER             ; 9AC5  7F 18 EF      CYLBAL_CYL_COUNTER = 0 | compare each cylinder with the previous-firing one (wraps to last); diff x CAL_CYLBAL_GAIN
