 4107:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 4108:                                 ; calc_idle_period_ratio_9DD4
 4109:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: IDLEDT90 = fraction kw_31F3 / max(engine_RPM, kw_31F3) (<=1.0): normalises the per-event
 4110:                                 ;        loop time so I and D gains are per unit time rather than per crank event.
 4111:                                 ;   OBD1 LE717 (match 1.00 p1-exact)
