 5171:                                 ; calc_cruise_gain_term_A46F
 5172:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Picks a 16-bit gain from tbl_2066 (A!=0) or tbl_206A (A=0), word 0 if CRUISE_STATE>4 else
 5173:                                 ;        word 1, signed-multiplies (MULS32) the cruise error word at 1A03 by it, saturates the result to a signed
 5174:                                 ;        24-bit value and stores it at 1A0F..1A11. Called from the cruise fuel controller A224 (OBD1 comment:
 5175:                                 ;        p-term).
 5176:                                 ;   OBD1 L7F7C (match 1.00 p1-exact)
 5177:                                 ;   called from: cruise_fuel_PID_A224
 5178:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
