 6402:                                 ;        (P/N vs driving above CAL_EGR_MIN_DRIVING_VSPD). EGR is shut (MAX_PRESS) after CAL_EGR_MAX_VSPD_DLY above
 6403:                                 ;        CAL_EGR_MAX_VSPEED or when fuel exceeds a baro-dependent threshold (tblOfs2D_EGR_fuel_thresh_BARO_224
