 6525:                                 ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 6526:                                 ; do_egr_igain
 6527:                                 ;   analysis [high]: EGR integrator: gain from tbl2D_EGR_INTEGRAL_GAIN (axis = baro margin computed in
 6528:                                 ;        EGR_control) * |error|, scaled, added to or subtracted from EGR_INTEG (clamped 0..7FFF). The integrator
 6529:                                 ;        is frozen when EGR is forced (FLAGS2.7) or the duty is saturated in the same direction (anti-windup).
