 6597:                                 ; EGR_vent_and_baro_sample_AE0A
 6598:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Controls the EGR vent solenoid (IOR_1800 b3) and baro sampling. It clears b3 (vent) when
 6599:                                 ;        EGR is disabled/faulted (FLAGS2.7, DTC bits 0028 b0/b1) or when the over-vacuum error >
 6600:                                 ;        CAL_EGR_VENT_PRESS (FLAGS2.6). After CAL_EGR_BARO_DELAY ticks vented it copies the AN7 sensor into
 6601:                                 ;        BARO_VOLTAGE and sets $C7.2. Otherwise it sets b3 and clears the timer. Scan-tool override via 1CC5/1CC6
 6602:                                 ;        b1.
