 9536:                                 ; filter_IAT_min_track_C675
 9537:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Called every 4th pass of the 50 ms torque-estimate task (b1:C586). When IAT_temp is below
 9538:                                 ;        $1CB5 it moves $1CB5 halfway toward IAT (rounded), so $1CB5 follows IAT only downward, likely as an
