10259:                                 ; J1850_mode36_download_execute_part_CBB0
10260:                                 ;   analysis [low]: Kicks the watchdogs, then polls the external J1850 controller word at $0C02 (up to 983 tries)
10261:                                 ;        until status bits 7-5 are non-zero. Returns the data byte (2nd byte) in A. C=1 means status >= $A0 with
10262:                                 ;        no error bits, C=0 means status < $A0. On timeout, or if the data byte has bit 6 or 7 set, it loops
10263:                                 ;        forever so the watchdog resets the ECM. Called from b1_sub_CA64.
10264:                                 ;   inferred [C, pass B]: only called from J1850_mode36_download_execute_CA64
