10561:                                 ; serial_task_CDCC
10562:                                 ;   analysis [low]: Dispatcher for normal-mode (non-diagnostic) broadcast messages. Bits from frame bytes 1 and 3
10563:                                 ;        index tbl_52B3, which gives an offset into tbl_53B3 (3-byte entries {msg id, handler-table ptr}, up to 6
10564:                                 ;        per group). On a match it calls b1:CD34 to get the frame type, then jumps to handler-table + 3*type. The
10565:                                 ;        handlers (about b1:CE38-D448, many mis-decoded as fcb/ptrtab) store received data into $1D8E-$1D
10566:                                 ;   inferred [C, pass B]: subsystem by references: SERIAL=3
10567:                                 ;   called from: J1850_rx_message_process_CBFD
