11447:                                 ;   analysis [medium]: Handles one diagnostic request. On the first call ($8D.3 clear) it checks the request:
11448:                                 ;        source address $F0-$FD (scan tool), request (not response) bit, header type. OBD2 modes $01-$04, $06
11449:                                 ;        (only if k_382B != 0) and $07 must be functional ($6A). Class-2 services
11450:                                 ;        $10,$12,$14,$17,$19,$20,$22,$23,$27,$28,$29,$2A,$2C,$34,$36,$3B,$3C,$3F,$A0,$A1,$AE must be physically
11451:                                 ;        addressed. It looks up a handler des
11452:                                 ;   called from: J1850_rx_message_process_CBFD
